O", "type": "*", "localized_name": "COMBO"}], "color": "#233", "widgets_values": ["Next Scene: [画面构图：中近景，过肩镜头] 从陆展肩后拍摄苏婉翻看手册，手册上的“互不打扰”四个字在焦点内；[视觉风格：温暖写实，柯达胶卷色调，轻微晕影] 固定机位，镜头从陆展侧面缓慢移到苏婉手指摩挲处，强调文字，然后切回苏婉同意\nNext Scene: [画面构图：侧面中景] 陆展在水槽边洗锅，背对镜头，苏婉坐在客厅沙发上侧影入镜；[视觉风格：纪实风格，自然光+顶灯，35mm镜头，广角略变形] 慢速推镜头，从陆展侧面推进至他洗锅的手部特写，然后水蒸气升腾模糊画面，过渡到下一镜头\nNext Scene: [画面构图：双人特写] 两人吃面，筷子在碗中夹面，镜头从碗中面条上移到苏婉额头浮汗、双眼低垂；然后切陆展苦笑；最后特写两双筷子同时夹住同一片青菜叶；[视觉风格：高饱和暖黄，浅景深，模仿日系生活剧]\nNext Scene: [画面构图：远景，广角] 客厅全景，苏婉在左侧厨房水槽洗碗（背影），陆展在右侧沙发看手机；[视觉风格：冷调写实，高对比，阴影浓重] 极慢速镜头拉远，从特写手机壁纸到中景人物面部表情（陆展微笑渐渐消失），再到全景，房间显得空旷，声音逐渐混响", 0, 1000, ""], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "start_index"}, "name": "start_index", "label": "start_index", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "start_index"}, {"widget": {"name": "max_rows"}, "name": "max_rows", "label": "max_rows", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "max_rows"}], "flags": {}, "type": "easy promptLine", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#355", "size": [789.4219970703125, 498.72174072265625], "pos": [3185.4404296875, 3264.0595703125], "id": 381, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-easy-use", "ver": "8ecc929cd41cf0f7ef6fcc45d4bbc5729c6f287f", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.2.2"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"start_index": true, "max_rows": true, "prompt": true}, "Node name for S&R": "easy promptLine"}, "order": 3}, {"outputs": [{"name": "conditioning_with_full_ref", "links": [502, 505], "label": "conditioning_with_full_ref", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "conditioning_with_full_ref"}, {"name": "latent", "links": [504], "label": "latent", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "latent"}, {"name": "target_image1", "links": [], "label": "target_image1", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "target_image1"}, {"name": "target_image2", "label": "target_image2", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "target_image2"}, {"name": "targe